    "Finding and applying a scoring method to potential targets to find the best one.": "为潜在目标设计并套用一套评分方法，从中挑出最优目标。",
    "The general approach is to compare the maximum money that could be stored on the server against the minimum security of the server. This ratio is an approximate money per time score for that server.": "通用思路是把服务器可容纳的最大钱数与其最低安全等级相比较，这个比值约等于该服务器的单位时间收益评分。",
