    "Controller": "控制器",
    "To resolve EHT's issues, we can manage the hack, grow and weaken functions from a centralized controller script.": "要解决 EHT 的问题，可以用一个集中式控制器脚本来调度 hack、grow 与 weaken 函数。",
    "The worker scripts can be as simple as": "工作脚本可以简单到只有：",
