    "Share power has a multiplicative effect on rep/second while doing hacking work for a faction. If you do non-hacking work, share power still increases the reputation gain rate, but the effect is non-linear.": "共享力量（share power）会对为派系做骇客工作时的每秒声望产生乘算影响。即使你做的是非骇客工作，共享力量仍会提高声望获取速率，但效果是非线性的。",
