    // ---- markdown/bitburner.ns.hack.md（核心函数详情页样板） ----
    "Returns:": "返回值：",
    "(Optional)": "(可选)",
    "A promise that resolves to the amount of money stolen (which is zero if the hack is unsuccessful).": "一个 Promise，解析为实际骇得的金额（若骇入失败则为 0）。",
    "RAM cost: 0.1 GB": "RAM 费用：0.1 GB",
    "Function that is used to try and hack servers to steal money and gain hacking experience. The runtime for this command depends on your hacking level and the target server’s security level when this function is called. In order to hack a server you must first gain root access to that server and also have the required hacking level.": "用于尝试骇入服务器以窃取金钱并获得骇客经验的函数。本命令的运行时长取决于调用此函数时你的骇客等级与目标服务器的安全等级。要骇入某服务器，你必须已获得其 root 权限并达到所需骇客等级。",
    // ---- markdown/bitburner.ns.grow.md / bitburner.ns.weaken.md ----
    "The total effective multiplier that was applied to the server's money (after both additive and multiplicative growth).": "施加到服务器金钱上的总有效倍率（加算生长与乘算生长共同作用后的结果）。",
    "RAM cost: 0.15 GB": "RAM 费用：0.15 GB",
    "Use your hacking skills to increase the amount of money available on a server.": "运用你的骇客技艺增加服务器上可用的金钱。",
    "Once the grow is complete, $1 is added to the server's available money for every script thread. This additive growth allows for rescuing a server even after it is emptied.": "生长完成后，每个脚本线程会向服务器可用金钱加算 $1。这种加算式生长让你在服务器被掏空后仍能把它救回来。",
    "After this addition, the thread count is also used to determine a multiplier, which the server's money is then multiplied by.": "在此加算之后，线程数还用于确定一个倍率，服务器的金钱再乘上该倍率。",
    "The multiplier scales exponentially with thread count, and its base depends on the server's security level and in inherent \"growth\" statistic that varies between different servers.": "该倍率随线程数呈指数增长，其底数取决于服务器安全等级与各服务器固有的、因服务器而异的\"生长\"属性。",
    " can be used to check the inherent growth statistic of a server.": " 可用于查看服务器的固有生长属性。",
    " can be used to determine the number of threads needed for a specified multiplicative portion of server growth.": " 可用于确定实现指定倍数生长所需的线程数。",
    "To determine the effect of a single grow, obtain access to the Formulas API and use ": "要确定单次 grow 的效果，请开通 Formulas API 并使用 ",
    ", or invert ": "，或对 ",
    "To determine how many threads are needed to return a server to max money, obtain access to the Formulas API and use ": "要确定把服务器恢复至满钱所需的线程数，请开通 Formulas API 并使用 ",
    ", or ": "，或 ",
    "if": "如果",
    " the server will be at the same security in the future.": " 该服务器未来的安全等级与当前相同。",
    "The grow() command requires root access to the target server, but there is no required hacking level to run the command. It also raises the security level of the target server based on the number of threads. The security increase can be determined using ": "grow() 指令需要目标服务器的 root 权限，但没有骇客等级要求；同时它会按线程数抬高目标服务器的安全等级。安全等级增幅可用 ",
    "A promise that resolves to the value by which security was reduced.": "一个 Promise，解析为安全等级实际下降的数值。",
    "Use your hacking skills to attack a server’s security, lowering the server’s security level. The runtime for this function depends on your hacking level and the target server’s security level when this function is called.": "运用你的骇客技艺攻击服务器的防御，降低其安全等级。本函数的运行时长取决于调用时你的骇客等级与目标服务器的安全等级。",
