    "). However, it is very strong to look for ways to actively surround empty space.": " 的点）。但主动寻找包围空域的走法要强得多。",
    // ---- darknet.md ----
    "For the full NS docs for the api, you can go to the ": "该 API 的完整 NS 文档见 ",
    "In order to access the darknet, you will need to purchase ": "要访问暗网，你需要先购买 ",
