    " tells you a server's password hint and format, and if the server is offline or connected to the current server.": " 会告诉你服务器的密码提示与格式，以及它是否离线、是否与当前服务器相连。",
    " lets you find darknet servers directly connected to your current server. Use this to find targets to crack and copy your script onto.": " 用于查找与当前服务器直连的暗网服务器。用它寻找可破解、可复制脚本的目标。",
    " lets you guess and check passwords for servers directly connected to your script's server. If you guess right, you get admin access and can use ": " 允许你猜测并验证与脚本所在服务器直连的服务器密码。猜对即获得 root 权限，可用 ",
